{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114421","id":3134660869,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc661yEF","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114421","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114421.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114421.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114421","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114421/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114421/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114421/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/44156bbdb09702696d2c77eaabd18b4ed3fa38b8","number":114421,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add mechanism to restore previously selected tab when transient tabs are lost/closed","user":{"login":"boozee","id":17431140,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDMxMTQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17431140?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/boozee","html_url":"https://github.com/boozee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boozee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boozee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boozee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boozee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boozee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boozee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boozee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boozee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/boozee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The PR addresses issue #114352 \r\n\r\nBefore: the default behaviour was to select the last (in the stack) available tab.\r\n\r\nThis PR implements proper tab restoration for transient docks by tracking the previously active non-transient tab per dock slot, and restoring it when a transient dock closes.\r\nNOTE: this fix applies to all transient docks, not just `TileMap` editor. The solution mirrors the existing `previous_tab` pattern used successfully in `EditorBottomPanel`.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d852558a-0808-4322-9a55-7e68c29bf133\r\n\r\nImplementation details:\r\n  1. When focusing a transient dock, the current non-transient tab index is saved in the dock slot\r\n  2. When closing a transient dock, the saved tab is restored (with validation)\r\n  3. If the saved tab is no longer valid, falls back to the first non-transient tab in the slot\r\n  4. Bottom panel explicitly excluded as it has its own tab management\r\n\r\nTested the following scenarios:\r\n  - Select `TileMap` node → deselect → Inspector tab restored\r\n  - Reorder tabs → deselect transient dock → correct tab restored (not dependent on tab order)\r\n  - Multiple transient docks → closes restore previous state in LIFO order\r\n  - Manual dock close via context menu → tab restored\r\n  - Only transient dock in slot → no crash, graceful handling\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2